# ============================================
# DOCS ARCHIVE (historical, not needed)
# ============================================
docs/archive/

# Internal research / prompt / report corpora stay local unless explicitly promoted.
docs/reports/
docs/instructions/
docs/research/

# Raw data corpora never belong in the repository, at any size. A 23.8 MB
# spreadsheet of another player's stats reached the public repo on 2026-08-19
# because nothing said no. The pre-push guard (scripts/git-hooks/pre-push)
# refuses these too — this is the second net, not the first.
# Only spreadsheets: the repo DOES deliberately track a research .csv that
# tooling reads (FULL_PROJECT_AUDIT_COVERAGE_2026-07-14.csv, consumed by
# scripts/git-hooks/pre-push), so a blanket rule for those would contradict
# what is already versioned. Size is handled by the pre-push guard instead,
# which is where the real risk was.
*.xlsx
*.xls

