# ============================================
# DOCS RETIRED 2026-08-20 — working notes, kept local, not published
# ============================================
# These were dated working documents: audits, RCAs, sprint reports, plans and
# handoffs that no code, test, workflow or living document refers to. They are
# how the work was done, not how the product runs, and a public repo that
# carries them makes the parts that DO matter harder to find.
#
# Nothing was thrown away. They stay in git history (restore any one with
#   git show 1c9e100e:<path> > <path>
# where 1c9e100e is the commit before this one), and a local copy lives in
# /home/samba/share/slomix-archive/docs-retired-2026-08-20/.
#
# A doc that code cites was NOT retired: 24 dated documents stayed exactly
# because a comment, test or router points at them — the citation is what
# makes them documentation rather than sediment.
#
# docs/research/ and docs/archive/ are covered by the directory rules above.

